"╭ ╭ Keys (vim) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                                    Room list (continued)                          │ │"
"│ │  Tab         Next pane                         g           First room                        │ │"
"│ │  Shift-Tab   Previous pane                     G           Last room                         │ │"
"│▌│  Alt-←       Go to the room list               l           Messages                          │ │"
"│ │  Alt-→       Go back to the chat               i           Composer                          │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↑       Go to the messages                /           Find in this room                 │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↓       Go to the composer               Messages                                       │ │"
"│ │  Alt-1       Room list                         ↑           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-2       Messages                          ↓           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-3       Composer                          Enter       Reply to selected message         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-R       Filter rooms                      e           Edit (own messages)               │ │"
"│ │  PgUp        Scroll messages up                r           React with an emoji               │ │"
"│ │  PgDn        Scroll messages down              Del         Delete message                    │ │"
"│ │  Esc         Close, cancel or go back          c           Copy text                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-E       Emoji picker                      C           Copy code block                   │ │"
"│ │  Alt-A       Attach a file                     O           Open in system viewer             │ │"
"│ │  F1          This help                         s           Save file or picture              │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↑      Previous room                     v           View picture                      │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↓      Next room                         o           Open link, picture or file        │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-F      Find in this room                 t           Open the message's thread         │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-G      Search all rooms                  p           Go to replied message             │ │"
"│ │  Alt-U       Jump to first unread              P           Pinned messages                   │ │"
"│ │  Alt-S       Next space (then all rooms)       T           Threads of this room              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-O       Filter: Unread only               d           Try decrypting again              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-D       Filter: People only               m           Menu for the message              │─╯"
"│ │  Ctrl-K      Find a room                       End         Jump to newest                    │─╮"
"│ │  F2          Settings                          ?           This help                         │ │"
"╰─│  F3          Next theme                        j           Newer message, then composer      │─╯"
" ●╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ↑↓ scroll · Esc to close ╯k "
